    "title": "Swiatek Advances to Semifinals; Alexandrova Also Progresses",
    "text": "Iga Swiatek has been dominant in the Qatar Open,showcasing her skills and⁢ resilience in multiple matches. In a notable victory,⁣ Swiatek overcame Elena Rybakina in straight sets, 7-6 (10-8) ⁣6-2, to win her third​ title in Doha [1[1 ]. This win is ​particularly ⁢notable as Swiatek⁢ had previously⁣ lost all three of her matches against Rybakina in ‌2023.\nswiatek’s path to the⁢ title included a strong performance against Maria‍ Sakkari in the second ‌round, where she won ⁢6-3 6-2 [2[2 ]. Her victory‍ over Rybakina was a‌ repeat of the​ 2023 ​final in Doha,‍ where Swiatek recovered from a⁣ break down in the second set to claim a 6-2 7-5 win [3[3 ].\nSwiatek’s success in Doha highlights her consistent‍ performance and dominance on the WTA circuit, having won the ⁢tournament three times consecutively in 2022, 2023, and⁣ 2024.",
